                  "text": "Yon 1.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inni lafa worra Israeli ta duri nyaapi fud'ate ch'ufa nyaapa suni dabsate iraa deebise, kaarra Hamathi ta mirgati fuud'e galaana Sooda ka bitaati d'aabe lafa ch'ufa deefate. Tunini waan AABBO Waaqi Israeli duri raaga Yona, ilma Amitai, ka worra Gath-Heferitini biyyati hime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
