              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan Yeroboamuni tolche ch'ufa, jannooma inni nyaapani had'eefi aka inni dira Damaskitifi Hamathi worra Israeliti deebise, kitaaba Odu Hayyoota Israeli keesati t'aafaniti t'aafani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
